...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit 화면 { class: ours }
seq: 순서 함수 { class: ours }
valuation: 매물 평가 { class: ours }
gemini: Gemini API { class: ext }

seq -> valuation: run(매물 JSON 프롬프트)
valuation -> gemini: generateContent
gemini -> valuation: Property N 평가 글
valuation -> seq: RunOutput.content
seq -> ui: dict (매물 · 분석 · 평가)
ui -> user: 지표 셋 + 탭 셋
